WEBVTT

00:10.690 --> 00:15.990
<i>When I throw a jab or a straight,
 it always lands</i>

00:15.990 --> 00:21.120
<i>But when I'm aiming for your heart,
 I miss every time</i>

00:21.120 --> 00:26.460
<i>Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent</i>

00:26.460 --> 00:30.960
<i>When you look my way and move closer to me</i>

00:30.960 --> 00:36.720
<i>I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you</i>

00:36.720 --> 00:41.770
<i>But I wish we could stay like this forever</i>

00:41.770 --> 00:47.900
<i>My changing feelings are driving me crazy</i>

00:47.900 --> 00:53.190
<i>The moment you turn to face me,
 take that! Telepathy</i>

00:53.190 --> 00:58.660
<i>If only we could feel the same thing</i>

00:58.660 --> 01:03.540
<i>I want to kick this pesky subtlety away</i>

01:03.540 --> 01:09.540
<i>I want to know everything, 
I want to know everything</i>

01:09.540 --> 01:12.090
<i>I can't fool you forever</i>

01:12.090 --> 01:14.720
<i>I can't keep this hidden</i>

01:14.720 --> 01:19.470
<i>I want to shout out my secret, AHHH</i>

01:21.390 --> 01:23.930
<i>Take that! Telepathy</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.390
<i>Te-te-te-telepathy</i>

01:27.100 --> 01:29.480
<i>Telepathy</i>

01:31.020 --> 01:34.990
<b>Junichiro's Promise</b>

01:31.860 --> 01:33.730
"Junichiro's Promise."

01:51.960 --> 01:54.510
What was your reason for getting so strong?

01:56.510 --> 02:01.550
I just wanted to catch up to the 
big back I saw in front of me.

02:04.520 --> 02:08.020
<i>I first met her ten years ago,</i>

02:09.850 --> 02:14.150
<i>the day after I moved here from Tokyo.</i>

02:22.740 --> 02:24.830
A-hup!

02:27.200 --> 02:29.960
You just moved in yesterday, right?

02:29.960 --> 02:31.420
Where'd you come from?

02:32.210 --> 02:33.340
Tokyo.

02:33.340 --> 02:34.670
Tokyo?!

02:34.670 --> 02:37.550
Isn't Tokyo the place with 
all the big, tall buildings,

02:37.550 --> 02:39.720
where everybody lives way up high?

02:39.720 --> 02:40.930
Did you, too?

02:41.430 --> 02:42.390
Yeah.

02:42.680 --> 02:44.350
That's so cool!

02:44.510 --> 02:47.060
Oh, and all the cars float in the air,

02:47.060 --> 02:49.390
and there are giant robots 
walking around, right?

02:49.770 --> 02:51.150
Yeah, sure.

02:51.150 --> 02:53.310
That's awesome!

02:54.150 --> 02:55.940
So, is that fun?

02:57.940 --> 03:00.780
Lemme see it for a sec!

02:59.780 --> 03:01.490
Hey, stop—

03:04.950 --> 03:07.790
Don't break it! Don't you dare break it!

03:07.790 --> 03:09.750
Don't worry!

03:09.750 --> 03:12.210
<b>2 Minutes Later</b>

03:14.210 --> 03:16.210
How does that even happen?!

03:16.210 --> 03:18.760
I guess I had a kinda hard grip on it—

03:25.470 --> 03:28.850
<i>Wh-What did I just do?</i>

03:29.430 --> 03:31.560
That's not enough.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.230
Huh?

03:33.100 --> 03:36.320
I broke something that was important to you.

03:36.730 --> 03:39.110
Hit me a hundred more times!

03:39.110 --> 03:41.860
I won't feel better until you do!

03:41.860 --> 03:44.030
I-It's fine...

03:44.030 --> 03:46.160
You're <i>sure</i> just one hit is enough?

03:46.160 --> 03:47.490
I'm sure!

03:48.290 --> 03:50.250
Well, now I owe ya one!

03:50.250 --> 03:53.170
I'm Tomo. What's your name?

03:53.750 --> 03:56.040
It's... Junichiro...

03:56.040 --> 03:57.540
Oh, yeah?

03:58.300 --> 03:59.760
Nice name!

04:00.960 --> 04:02.760
Greetings!

04:05.390 --> 04:07.510
You must be Junichiro.

04:07.510 --> 04:09.140
Y-Yes, sir!

04:10.390 --> 04:12.890
I am terribly sorry!

04:12.890 --> 04:14.650
Huh?!

04:14.650 --> 04:17.360
My Tomo caused unspeakable trouble for you.

04:17.560 --> 04:20.780
<i>The kid actually went and 
told him what happened?</i>

04:20.780 --> 04:22.740
<i>A big, scary dad like him?</i>

04:22.740 --> 04:26.620
As Tomo's father, I will naturally 
pay for all damages caused,

04:26.620 --> 04:28.780
but is there anything else I can do?

04:28.780 --> 04:31.160
No, really, everything's fine now.

04:31.160 --> 04:34.120
That does not placate me!

04:35.120 --> 04:36.580
<i>They're definitely related!</i>

04:36.580 --> 04:39.340
Hey, Goro! What are you doing?!

04:39.550 --> 04:40.750
Akemi!

04:40.750 --> 04:44.300
Don't terrorize the new neighbors!
 They just moved in!

04:45.930 --> 04:46.760
Um...

04:47.090 --> 04:49.140
Why are they behind me?

04:49.140 --> 04:50.970
I'm sorry about that.

04:50.970 --> 04:53.640
These idiots of mine are 
bothering you, aren't they?

04:55.020 --> 04:56.400
I-It's okay...

04:57.270 --> 04:58.810
All right, come with me!

05:00.150 --> 05:03.280
I'll settle this with his 
parents myself later.

05:03.280 --> 05:05.570
Be sure to make up with him, okay?

05:05.900 --> 05:06.660
Okay.

05:09.530 --> 05:12.950
I'm really sorry I broke your game.

05:13.580 --> 05:17.000
We're the same age, and we live next door,

05:17.000 --> 05:20.380
so I'd really like to be your friend.

05:20.380 --> 05:21.590
Can I?

05:22.420 --> 05:25.300
That's... fine with me.

05:33.020 --> 05:37.230
<i>From then on, Tomo and I played 
together almost every day.</i>

05:42.940 --> 05:48.610
You've gotta be crazy!

05:48.910 --> 05:53.450
Hey, gamer kid! Aren't you 
gonna come outside today?

05:53.450 --> 05:55.290
Do I look like I can go outside?

05:55.290 --> 05:57.290
And stop calling me a gamer kid.

05:57.290 --> 06:01.250
Well, you never call me by my name, either!

06:01.250 --> 06:04.630
It's always "Hey, you," or "monkey," 
or "idiot," or something!

06:05.590 --> 06:07.050
Sorry.

06:07.800 --> 06:10.010
Okay, then... Tomo.

06:12.760 --> 06:14.600
Say it one more time!

06:14.600 --> 06:17.100
Huh? T-Tomo...

06:18.600 --> 06:22.400
For some reason, it makes me really 
happy when you call me by my name!

06:22.400 --> 06:23.480
Why is that?!

06:24.230 --> 06:27.650
<i>This can't be right... This can't be right!</i>

06:30.740 --> 06:31.660
Hey, Jun!

06:32.620 --> 06:34.830
Mind if she plays with us today?

06:35.120 --> 06:37.120
This is Misuzu. We've been friends forever.

06:37.120 --> 06:38.710
Be her friend too, okay?

06:39.960 --> 06:41.630
<i>She looks like a doll.</i>

06:43.540 --> 06:45.460
So you're Junichiro?

06:45.920 --> 06:48.050
I hear you came here from Tokyo.

06:48.050 --> 06:49.840
Th-That's right.

06:50.180 --> 06:53.010
You have the face of a bumpkin, though.

06:55.260 --> 06:57.560
Isn't she hilarious?

06:57.560 --> 06:59.890
She'll pick a fight with anyone!

06:59.890 --> 07:02.020
That's not hilarious!

07:04.360 --> 07:06.440
I've never gone out to catch bugs before.

07:06.780 --> 07:08.740
What kinds of bugs can we catch?

07:08.740 --> 07:11.570
We have stag beetles and rhinoceros beetles.

07:11.570 --> 07:12.910
Really?!

07:13.700 --> 07:16.660
I don't wanna go to any 
more weird places, though!

07:16.660 --> 07:19.160
No climbing cliffs or crossing rivers!

07:20.910 --> 07:22.460
Don't worry!

07:23.670 --> 07:26.920
We'll catch our bugs at the 
top of these stairs today.

07:28.380 --> 07:30.090
It's only about two hundred steps.

07:44.310 --> 07:46.900
<i>Is this kid some kind of monster?</i>

07:55.320 --> 07:57.700
Wow, he's sure fired up!

07:57.700 --> 07:58.830
What a child.

08:00.290 --> 08:01.870
T-Take that!

08:02.330 --> 08:04.630
I got here first!

08:05.920 --> 08:07.840
That was awesome!

08:09.760 --> 08:11.010
You look pathetic.

08:12.170 --> 08:15.760
In the end, the one still 
standing is the winner.

08:16.800 --> 08:21.140
I'm gonna make you cry like a baby later!

08:22.770 --> 08:25.850
You guys are such good friends already!

08:30.730 --> 08:32.110
Look, Jun!

08:32.950 --> 08:34.700
I found a big one!

08:35.200 --> 08:39.200
Wow, a giant stag beetle!

08:39.200 --> 08:41.450
That's just a giant cockroach.

08:41.450 --> 08:42.580
Gross.

08:42.580 --> 08:45.830
Awesome! I've never seen 
one like this before!

08:45.830 --> 08:48.040
These sell for thousands in stor—

08:49.210 --> 08:50.630
Beautiful!

08:50.630 --> 08:54.050
Hey, you finally get it now, too?

08:54.050 --> 08:56.090
<i>What's with this girl?!</i>

08:58.260 --> 08:59.760
Look, Tomo!

08:59.760 --> 09:01.640
I got one, too!

09:01.640 --> 09:03.480
Hey, nice!

09:03.890 --> 09:06.020
It looks so cool!

09:08.110 --> 09:11.570
Hey, so you <i>can</i> smile!

09:11.570 --> 09:14.070
Huh? What do you mean by that?

09:14.070 --> 09:17.660
Well, you're always making 
those sulky faces.

09:18.570 --> 09:21.950
See? Playing outside every now 
and then isn't so bad, right?

09:22.450 --> 09:24.540
Well, every now and then...

09:31.170 --> 09:33.960
Come on, hurry up!

09:34.260 --> 09:37.180
You've gotten pretty good at climbing trees!

09:37.180 --> 09:39.220
A little climb like this is nothing.

09:40.800 --> 09:43.310
I can't call you a gamer kid anymore!

09:43.310 --> 09:46.390
That's right! Never call me that again!

09:46.850 --> 09:51.150
<i>I was finally able to keep 
up with Tomo's crazy games.</i>

09:51.570 --> 09:53.780
<i>Somehow, just being with Tomo</i>

09:53.780 --> 09:58.110
<i>made me feel like I had gotten stronger.</i>

10:03.580 --> 10:04.950
<i>But that was just...</i>

10:04.950 --> 10:05.830
Hey!

10:09.000 --> 10:11.290
That's a pretty cool thing you've got there.

10:14.210 --> 10:16.130
<i>...a big misunderstanding.</i>

10:18.550 --> 10:19.510
Hey...

10:19.890 --> 10:21.760
What happened to your cheek?

10:21.760 --> 10:25.060
Huh? Oh... I just fell.

10:25.890 --> 10:28.140
You're a real klutz, aren't you?

10:29.520 --> 10:32.610
Yeah, I sure am! I gotta be more careful!

10:33.520 --> 10:36.570
What are you laughing about?

10:36.570 --> 10:38.150
You're so confusing.

10:42.450 --> 10:43.450
Here ya go.

10:46.950 --> 10:49.000
Why did you have this?

10:49.000 --> 10:51.250
Oh, well...

10:51.880 --> 10:53.790
I found it lying on the ground!

10:54.090 --> 10:55.130
What?!

10:55.920 --> 10:59.050
What were you thinking?! 
You got it back alone?!

10:59.300 --> 11:00.680
Hey, hang on...

11:00.680 --> 11:02.550
Why would you take a risk like that?!

11:04.220 --> 11:06.680
What do you think you're doing?

11:09.560 --> 11:12.520
Why do you do things like this?

11:12.520 --> 11:13.360
Huh?

11:13.730 --> 11:17.860
I never asked you to get it back for me!

11:18.110 --> 11:20.400
I dunno what you're talking about,

11:20.400 --> 11:24.330
but if you're having trouble with something,
 of course I'm gonna help you.

11:24.700 --> 11:26.200
We're friends, aren't we?

11:26.790 --> 11:29.790
<i>Don't make it sound so simple!</i>

11:32.330 --> 11:37.000
<i>I can't do anything like that for you!</i>

11:42.890 --> 11:43.970
Here.

11:44.600 --> 11:46.100
You can borrow it.

11:46.100 --> 11:48.270
Really? You're sure?

11:48.270 --> 11:49.100
Yeah.

11:49.730 --> 11:51.520
Thanks!

11:51.520 --> 11:53.480
How long can I borrow it?

11:53.900 --> 11:54.940
Until...

11:56.190 --> 11:58.730
Until I'm a stronger man than you.

11:58.730 --> 12:00.240
When that time comes...

12:00.780 --> 12:02.240
I'll take it back!

12:02.990 --> 12:05.490
Aizawa Dojo

12:05.490 --> 12:09.790
How much stronger you get 
from now on is up to you.

12:10.040 --> 12:11.460
I won't go easy on you.

12:11.460 --> 12:12.250
Yes, sir!

12:12.250 --> 12:13.620
Please teach me!

12:13.620 --> 12:15.460
You will respond with "Osu"!

12:15.460 --> 12:16.960
O-Osu!

12:30.930 --> 12:32.850
<i>It's really been ten years?</i>

12:33.640 --> 12:34.900
<i>And I still...</i>

12:38.520 --> 12:40.990
Yes! I beat the game!

12:43.070 --> 12:46.620
How many dozens of times does that make now?

12:46.620 --> 12:49.330
When's he gonna come to take this thing back?

12:49.330 --> 12:54.080
He's already way stronger than me.

12:57.130 --> 13:00.920
<b>When Tomo Puts On</b>

12:57.130 --> 13:00.920
<b>a Swimsuit...</b>

12:57.670 --> 13:00.090
"When Tomo Puts On a Swimsuit..."

13:02.800 --> 13:04.130
We're here.

13:04.130 --> 13:05.510
Heya!

13:06.140 --> 13:07.640
Hey!

13:07.930 --> 13:11.430
<i>We all decided to go to the beach 
together over summer break.</i>

13:08.600 --> 13:12.390
Hey, you're supposed to inflate 
the swim ring <i>after</i> we get there!

13:12.600 --> 13:16.440
So you really came? I thought you 
had no interest in the beach.

13:16.730 --> 13:19.110
I wasn't intending to come...

13:19.730 --> 13:21.730
Well, you got a new swimsuit.

13:21.730 --> 13:25.070
Now you don't have to be shy about 
going to the beach with Junichiro.

13:25.070 --> 13:30.370
Yeah, but I don't know if I have the guts 
to play around with him in this swimsuit.

13:30.370 --> 13:32.200
Want me to go with you?

13:32.200 --> 13:33.540
You'll come with us?

13:33.540 --> 13:34.870
Carol, please.

13:36.040 --> 13:40.380
I bet Jun-kun's face when he sees Tomo-chan 
in a swimsuit will be amazing.

13:42.630 --> 13:45.590
...but I'm looking forward to this, Junichiro.

13:45.590 --> 13:47.050
To what?

13:47.050 --> 13:49.090
This is for you, Jun-kun.

13:49.090 --> 13:50.470
Hey, cut it out!

13:50.470 --> 13:52.220
Carry the parasol, too.

13:52.510 --> 13:53.890
Why do I have to—

13:53.890 --> 13:55.350
And wear these.

13:55.350 --> 13:57.690
H-Hey, you guys...

13:57.940 --> 14:00.810
He looks like that one guy in the group 
who's fired up when no one else is.

14:00.810 --> 14:03.150
You're a bit too excited, Junichiro.

14:04.610 --> 14:07.700
Calm down, Jun! There, there!

14:18.460 --> 14:19.460
It's...

14:19.460 --> 14:20.420
...the...

14:20.420 --> 14:21.710
...beach!

14:26.880 --> 14:28.260
Woo-hoo.

14:28.260 --> 14:30.720
Yeah!

14:42.230 --> 14:44.360
Thanks for waiting, Jun-kun.

14:45.190 --> 14:46.820
Where's Tomo?

14:48.990 --> 14:50.820
Why are you looking up?

14:51.780 --> 14:56.040
<b>Shower Room</b>

14:51.780 --> 14:56.040
<b>Changing Room</b>

14:51.780 --> 14:56.040
<b>Entrance</b>

14:51.780 --> 14:56.040
<b>Woman</b>

14:53.280 --> 14:55.660
Tomo's hiding over there.

14:58.750 --> 15:00.620
What're you hiding for?

15:00.620 --> 15:01.500
Jun!

15:01.500 --> 15:03.710
You're not supposed to be wearing a hoodie.

15:04.090 --> 15:05.960
Take that off and let's go swim—

15:14.680 --> 15:16.890
C-Can't breathe...

15:22.350 --> 15:23.980
Yay!

15:23.980 --> 15:26.070
This is the best!

15:26.280 --> 15:28.240
Feels so nice.

15:29.030 --> 15:32.740
It's unusual for you to 
come over to me by choice.

15:33.160 --> 15:36.790
Shut up. There's just nowhere else I can sit.

15:36.790 --> 15:39.370
So Carol and Tomo are too 
much of a temptation,

15:40.080 --> 15:43.750
but being around me doesn't 
bother you at all?

15:46.050 --> 15:48.380
Let me hit you just once.

15:49.010 --> 15:50.760
I didn't even say anything.

15:51.680 --> 15:53.220
Hey, Jun!

15:53.640 --> 15:55.680
Why are you sitting down?

15:55.680 --> 15:57.140
T-Tomo?!

15:57.140 --> 15:58.970
Let's hit the water!

15:59.270 --> 16:01.560
Come on, hurry up!

16:00.810 --> 16:03.480
W-Wait, you idiot! Don't cling to my arm!

16:03.480 --> 16:04.940
Why not?

16:03.690 --> 16:05.480
Stop! Get away!

16:04.480 --> 16:08.110
<i>She's enjoying the beach so much, 
she forgot about the swimsuit.</i>

16:05.480 --> 16:06.730
Come on!

16:06.730 --> 16:08.440
Tomo! Please!

16:09.110 --> 16:12.400
<i>Tomo, you probably haven't noticed...</i>

16:14.740 --> 16:18.540
<i>But you're being just the right 
kind of aggressive right now.</i>

16:22.120 --> 16:23.250
Gah!

16:23.580 --> 16:24.920
What's wrong?

16:24.920 --> 16:27.800
Like, Aizawa Tomo and the 
blonde boob chick are here!

16:27.800 --> 16:29.300
F-For real?!

16:30.590 --> 16:32.300
Take that!

16:35.390 --> 16:38.180
Whoa... She's pretty 
impressive without clothes.

16:38.180 --> 16:41.350
I, like, wouldn't ever 
want to stand beside her.

16:41.350 --> 16:42.850
You said it.

16:42.850 --> 16:44.230
Like, who are you?

16:44.480 --> 16:46.480
Jun-kun! Jun-kun!

16:49.070 --> 16:50.900
Don't get close to me!

17:02.500 --> 17:06.250
Was splashing around always that painful?

17:06.250 --> 17:08.670
Anything is a weapon in <i>her</i> hands.

17:09.170 --> 17:14.340
Anyway, why does Jun-kun keep running 
away from Tomo-chan and me?

17:14.340 --> 17:16.220
He's fine around you.

17:16.220 --> 17:20.140
You don't actually know what 
you just said, do you?

17:20.140 --> 17:21.180
It's this.

17:22.430 --> 17:25.020
Do you mean Jun-kun doesn't like boobs?

17:25.020 --> 17:27.650
No. The opposite.

17:29.400 --> 17:33.110
He's a pervert who loves big boobs.

17:33.110 --> 17:35.030
I don't get it.

17:39.120 --> 17:41.830
Man, the beach really is fun!

17:41.830 --> 17:44.200
Hey, you there!

17:44.200 --> 17:45.960
You're a cutie!

17:45.960 --> 17:47.880
A-Are you talking about me?

17:47.880 --> 17:50.670
Yeah, you! I'm talking about you!

17:52.170 --> 17:55.510
That's the first time a guy 
I don't know ever said that to me!

17:55.510 --> 17:56.430
Huh?

17:57.130 --> 18:00.550
What did you see on me that made 
you think that? Tell me in detail!

18:00.890 --> 18:02.470
Okay, okay!

18:02.470 --> 18:05.020
I'll tell you everything.

18:06.140 --> 18:08.400
Around those big rocks over there...

18:08.400 --> 18:10.360
Where we can take our time.

18:10.650 --> 18:13.730
<i>Wait, I'm kinda... scared.</i>

18:13.730 --> 18:16.200
C'mon, let's get moving.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.570
H-Hang on!

18:17.910 --> 18:19.990
Wow, you're strong!

18:19.990 --> 18:21.990
<i>I wanna slug him into orbit right now!</i>

18:21.990 --> 18:23.410
Hey, chill out.

18:23.620 --> 18:25.080
<i>But I can't!</i>

18:25.080 --> 18:27.330
<i>I don't think I could hold back!</i>

18:27.330 --> 18:29.120
Are you being shy?

18:29.120 --> 18:30.920
That's part of what makes you cu—

18:34.460 --> 18:35.210
Huh?

18:35.210 --> 18:37.880
Wh-Where did you come from?! 
You her boyfriend?!

18:37.880 --> 18:39.970
Huh? No way.

18:40.180 --> 18:42.430
Then why'd you get between us?!

18:42.430 --> 18:46.310
I don't really know why, 
but you're just wrong.

18:46.310 --> 18:48.390
Don't touch Tomo with your filthy hands.

18:51.360 --> 18:54.320
<i>I wish he'd say that one more time...</i>

18:54.320 --> 18:58.200
<i>One more time... One more time...</i>

18:56.440 --> 18:58.990
Sorry. I shouldn't have butted in.

18:59.360 --> 19:00.110
Huh?

19:00.450 --> 19:04.030
You wouldn't want people thinking 
I'm your boyfriend, right?

19:04.870 --> 19:07.250
<i>I wouldn't?!</i>

19:07.250 --> 19:08.790
<i>What's wrong with this idiot?!</i>

19:08.790 --> 19:12.500
<i>Does it bug him that much to have 
people think we're a couple?!</i>

19:09.290 --> 19:12.500
<b>Wouldn't</b>

19:09.920 --> 19:12.500
<b>Want</b>

19:12.500 --> 19:16.170
Jun-kun! Help!

19:19.800 --> 19:20.680
Jun?

19:20.680 --> 19:23.100
What are you doing? Let's go.

19:24.100 --> 19:25.260
Thanks!

19:25.260 --> 19:27.810
Who the hell are you? Her boyfriend?

19:28.810 --> 19:30.520
My boyfriend, he said!

19:30.520 --> 19:33.020
Go ahead and think that if you want. 
I can't be bothered with you.

19:33.020 --> 19:35.860
<i>Wh-What?!</i>

19:36.480 --> 19:40.150
He wouldn't want people thinking 
he and I are a couple?

19:40.150 --> 19:42.110
But <i>she's</i> fine?!

19:42.110 --> 19:44.580
Isn't that a good thing?

19:44.580 --> 19:46.490
Like hell it is!

19:46.870 --> 19:49.410
If you really want to change 
the way things are,

19:49.410 --> 19:51.080
today's your best chance to do it.

19:51.080 --> 19:54.250
It is?! Wh-What should I do?!

19:54.670 --> 19:57.630
Get as close to Junichiro as you can,

19:57.630 --> 20:00.220
and always stay within his line of sight.

20:01.470 --> 20:02.680
That's it?

20:02.970 --> 20:04.090
That's it.

20:04.640 --> 20:06.600
<b>Soft Serve</b>

20:06.180 --> 20:09.020
Jun! I bought us soft serve!

20:09.020 --> 20:10.140
Really?

20:10.140 --> 20:13.350
Yep! It's on me. Eat up!

20:13.350 --> 20:14.860
Thanks.

20:17.690 --> 20:20.280
<i>Is this getting close enough?</i>

20:20.280 --> 20:21.320
<i>Closer, maybe?</i>

20:24.280 --> 20:26.950
<i>Is this really all I need to do?</i>

20:26.950 --> 20:28.740
<i>He's not reacting at all.</i>

20:34.750 --> 20:37.630
<i>Tomo... What's gotten into you?</i>

20:39.340 --> 20:40.800
Whoa! That's cold!

20:40.800 --> 20:42.510
Oh, sorry.

20:44.840 --> 20:48.140
It's fine. I'm getting back 
in the water later, anyway.

20:54.310 --> 20:56.230
Huh? Something wrong?

20:56.230 --> 20:58.320
Uh... Nah, nothing.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.780
Let's get in the water again!

21:03.990 --> 21:05.820
S-Sure...

21:08.530 --> 21:11.200
<i>Something's been a little 
off with me lately.</i>

21:12.290 --> 21:16.670
<i>There were all kinds of things 
I wanted to do with Tomo today,</i>

21:17.040 --> 21:20.130
<i>but every time she touches me...</i>

21:20.750 --> 21:22.670
<i>Every time she smiles at me...</i>

21:24.470 --> 21:26.430
<i>I suddenly can't move.</i>

21:40.850 --> 21:42.440
Why do you look so smug?

21:42.670 --> 21:46.580
You didn't seem like you were having 
much fun at the beach today.

21:47.090 --> 21:48.320
Did something happen?

21:48.720 --> 21:51.260
Huh? No, not really...

21:51.780 --> 21:55.280
Actually, maybe something did happen.

21:56.080 --> 22:00.310
<i>I knew it. I'm still not sure 
what it is he wants to do,</i>

22:01.760 --> 22:07.010
<i>but he doesn't see Tomo as 
anything but a girl anymore.</i>

22:10.800 --> 22:14.560
<i>(This suspicious behavior is...)</i>

22:14.560 --> 22:18.850
<i>Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up</i>

22:18.850 --> 22:23.320
<i>It's too complicated, I'm freaking out</i>

22:23.320 --> 22:25.860
<i>I want to look cute to you</i>

22:23.650 --> 22:29.200
<i>(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)</i>

22:25.860 --> 22:28.490
<i>So I'm plotting, bargaining, 
sly, and stubborn</i>

22:29.200 --> 22:32.990
<i>Dizzying love</i>

22:34.160 --> 22:38.580
<i>Just tell him to look at you</i>

22:38.580 --> 22:43.550
<i>And watch him stiffen up even more, 
because you're both so awkward</i>

22:43.550 --> 22:47.420
<i>What? Even if we're alike in that way</i>

22:47.420 --> 22:52.010
<i>It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it
 means our love is going nowhere</i>

22:52.010 --> 23:00.900
<i>Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—
I sense rain coming</i>

23:00.900 --> 23:09.990
<i>So I partly open my umbrella, 
then sneakily scoot closer to you</i>

23:09.990 --> 23:13.950
<i>Please notice the curl of my 
eyelashes as I keep blinking</i>

23:13.950 --> 23:18.870
<i>And don't say I'm acting weird</i>

23:18.870 --> 23:22.840
<i>All this plotting and bargaining 
is my sly plan to look cute to you</i>

23:22.840 --> 23:27.880
<i>Try to solve the riddle of 
this soft, dizzying love</i>

23:25.750 --> 23:30.010
<i>(Buzzing, fidgeting)</i>

23:30.260 --> 23:34.810
<i>Listen, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:34.810 --> 23:38.850
<i>But once you unravel the mystery, 
you'll see pure lo-love</i>
